"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQuHPW_bMAE8WJ8.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[{"h":1147,"w":2048,"x":0,"y":0},{"h":1366,"w":1366,"x":289,"y":0},{"h":1366,"w":1198,"x":373,"y":0},{"h":1366,"w":683,"x":631,"y":0},{"h":1366,"w":2048,"x":0,"y":0}],"height":1366,"width":2048},"sizes":{"large":{"h":1366,"resize":"fit","w":2048},"medium":{"h":800,"resize":"fit","w":1200},"small":{"h":454,"resize":"fit","w":680},"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"photo","url":"https://t.co/HlYckeZVHz"}]},"favorite_count":984,"favorited":false,"full_text":"／\n📢退職自衛隊員・御家族への支援を強化！\n＼\n \n8月27日、第2回「退職自衛隊員・家族に対する支援の強化に関する検討委員会」を開催しました。 https://t.co/HlYckeZVHz","id_str":"2092915160092680393","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":154,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"268732024"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp/j/policy/agend…","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/j/policy/agenda/meeting/support-for-retired/20260827.html","indices":[239,262],"url":"https://t.co/SKbM2vTywl"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwOTI5MTUxNTk5NzUzMDkzMTI=","text":"／\n📢退職自衛隊員・御家族への支援を強化！\n＼\n \n8月27日、第2回「退職自衛隊員・家族に対する支援の強化に関する検討委員会」を開催しました。\n \n小泉防衛大臣から、「退職自衛隊員・家族支援庁（仮称）」の新設に向けて、関連施策を令和9年度概算要求に反映するようにと指示があり、予算案が取りまとめられる年末に向けて引き続き施策の検討を深化させていくこととなりました。\n \n防衛省は、一歩ずつ確実に、退職自衛隊員・御家族への支援強化を進めてまいります。\n \n👇詳しくはこちら\n🔗 https://t.co/SKbM2vTywl"}}},"rest_id":"2092915160092680393","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"36124","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2092915160092680393","sortIndex":"2093208165607800754"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":